- Glucose lane: [[Metformin-Empagliflozin FDC (500-5mg×300tab) — shopee-china]], standalone metformin offers, standalone empagliflozin offers, [[Acarbose (50mg×100tab) — shopee-china]], [[Dihydroberberine (200mg×60tab) — iHerb]]
